  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>You are adept at preparing a large group for the environments ahead.</em></p>\n<p>You can grant the benefits of your acclimation to a number of creatures or vehicles equal to the ranks you possess in a package’s associated skill of your choice (chosen when using this ability) + your operative ability modifier. As a standard action, you may change an acclimation affecting a touched creature to a different acclimation you could apply.</p>\n<p>Additionally, you can have up to two instances of the pathing ability active at one time. Alternatively, you can use pathing as a full-round action to apply two (pathing) talents to the area (each talent is treated as their own instance of the pathing ability).</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/navigation#toc27\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
